Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不...不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别发出奇怪的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体真够僵硬的啊 沟口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但头脑和精神很柔韧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.82,0:00:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得一样僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但钱包和贞操坚不可摧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么冒出贞操来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（我对男子啦啦队很感兴趣）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.17,0:00:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有第四个人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,COME ON——! !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:15.07,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}结束漫不经心度过的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:19.07,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}满心想要脱离现状
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:24.70,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我总是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:28.87,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}每次是你牵着我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:34.71,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}带我去看新的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:37.05,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}世界变幻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:39.13,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}迈出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:42.38,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}仿佛带来了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:48.31,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不再担心 我们在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:49.85,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:51.44,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}以最本真的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.56,0:01:54.65,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}虽也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:02:01.32,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}但有太多事情 不试试没法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:02.82,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:07.83,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}伸手仿佛能触碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:10.96,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}我们不再孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:16.09,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:15.07,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:19.07,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:24.70,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:28.87,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:34.71,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:37.05,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:39.13,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:42.38,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:48.31,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:49.85,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:51.44,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.56,0:01:54.65,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:02:01.32,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:02.82,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:07.83,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:10.96,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:16.09,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur6}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是学生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要说起来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通疑问句最后都会加个「吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就和日语一样 会在句末的「です」后面加个「か」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.40,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,第四个人怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用「ですか」来构成疑问句
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:56.38,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,约好了去向日葵食堂面谈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咋回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫 虫爬到我胳膊上了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一次来这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为命志院的学生 总来过一两次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家是开{\u1}料亭{\u0}的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:33.54,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：料亭：高级的传统日本料理餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家里人叫我别进这种便宜的店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,店长 猪排咖喱还没好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要吃这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请帮我加油啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么开始
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.35,0:03:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我开吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:03:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20分钟之内吃完就免费
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,申请入部的就是这人？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说这名字我好像在哪看过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:12.30,左上记,NTP,0,0,0,,远野：我对男子拉拉队很感兴趣\N阿一：十分感谢！具体事情的话，\N明天午饭时在向日葵食堂谈怎么样？\N远野：明白了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久没见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的记录还没被破呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远野浩司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨大猪排咖喱最短纪录保持者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.81,0:04:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为是柔道部的历代主将呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我高中时的照片 太不好意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是男子啦啦队的成员吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是桥本一马 这是坂东晴希
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都是社会学部一年级的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沟口涉 商学部一年级
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是文学部的一年级学生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 不知方不方便...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行 有问题随便问
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 我想点餐...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请给我一份猪排咖喱乌冬饭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.97,0:05:05.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是秘密菜单上的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没吃完 哎 真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咋回事 咋就走了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差1400日元
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到传单就给我发邮件了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那阿远你...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.99,0:05:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿远？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫远野所以简称阿远啊 还能是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别乱给人起绰号
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:35.37,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：「阿远」的日语发音「トン」(ton)和「豚」(猪) 相同
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不也是互相称呼阿晴阿一的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不介意的话也可以叫我阿沟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那阿远你现在体重多少
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么突然问这个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 大约100公斤...吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:55.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有参加过什么运动？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 你不用道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不同体型在啦啦队里都有合适的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过...为什么选择进啦啦队？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想改变
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Today is the first day of the rest of the your life
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是你余生的第一天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电影《美国丽人》中的一句台司
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这句话真经典
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 你刚说不同体型在啦啦队里都有合适的位置...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.41,0:06:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来解释
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个在最高处举起双手的人是{\u1}尖子{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:55.95,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1368,930)}top
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉就像是最耀眼的明星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为需要做跳跃动作 所以多由小个子担任
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.71,0:07:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们之中的话 我和阿晴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抬着尖子的是{\u1}底座{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:09.09,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1148.571,930)}base
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要用肩膀扛起尖子 或是双手把人托举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个位置适合体格健壮的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:16.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿远啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在后面扶着的是{\u1}后点{\u0} 作用是辅助底座
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:23.15,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(953.143,930)}spot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.27,0:07:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是支撑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如托举尖子的时机等等 都得由后点来指挥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好比指挥台
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给每个人都刻录了一份
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...队员还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,参加大赛需要16个人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼下的目标是召集7个人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后在十月学园祭上亮相
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:31.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的要退出柔道部？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为受了伤？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为成绩不佳？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我反对 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要放弃柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成绩这东西 多努力总能出的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...想去...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...尖子 底座 后点是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得我是适合尖子...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的要当这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:54.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家也都试试
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我能做到 能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个 阿远
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.43,0:10:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三点倒立
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽量学会只用双手倒立吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走起来更容易保持平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 停得下来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒立还能练肌肉 锻炼平衡感
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以每天都得记着练倒立
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及拉伸也要每天做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体不够柔韧的话容易受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对翻腾动作也有影响
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻...翻什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻腾 指后翻或者空翻之类
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴是尖子 到时候得练习翻腾的跳跃翻转动作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.97,0:11:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关、关于这个我当尖子...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 你可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会努力练倒立和拉伸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来练习喊口号
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟是应援嘛 要大声些 精神着点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那大家排好队
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来 开始
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.38,0:11:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再笑灿烂些
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别不出声啊 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 笑容 笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 确实很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不知我能不能学会倒立
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前没运动过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这种人 不擅长在人前表现自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为阿一说想组建啦啦队 我才跟着加入了进来而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是阿远 你是为了改变自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才主动加入的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真的很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是翻腾啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被巨大猪排咖喱打败的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,网球同好会？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.79,0:12:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓢虫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可这和网球没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:12:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好意思说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 去吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:09.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家来干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.37,0:13:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说你们是{\u1}社团难民{\u0}？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:47.60,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：社团难民：想进社团却找不到可以加入的社团的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴顺着他的话往下说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:53.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就是按这设定混进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也太土鳘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.69,0:13:59.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进了我们社团 也不代表一定能找到女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 下次要不要去学校附近新开的意大利餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意大利餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喝酒了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经满二十了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是一年级吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浪人 不会把你做成{\u1}蜡人{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:17.13,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：浪人和蜡人音相同。\N蜡人：指未能一次考上大学后复读再考的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不明白什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可真有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是抖包袱又是吐槽的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你俩都是关西人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我东京出身
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逗我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺带一提我叫总一郎 大家都叫我一郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这小子是弦 我们是商学部一年级的人气组合
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.65,0:14:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪来的人气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 这里不该笑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才看你的后翻很漂亮 以前参加过什么运动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直是棒球部的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是足球部的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙醉了 没救了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没醉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棒球部和足球部啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么现在进网球部了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为一直是搞体育的 身边全是汉子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以想进大学之后找个时髦点的社团
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就你这脑袋还好意思说时髦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...不觉得眼下不太符合你们的想法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来我们这儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们那儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦队？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不是社团难民吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来这里 是为了拉你们入队
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你们干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦队？啦啦队是不是那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿着短裙一边挥舞花球一边跳舞的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是变态吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:16:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的 我们要加油呐喊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为那些拼了命地做某件事的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为那些执着的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就和传单上写的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他人的应援 将成为主角
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,助他人一臂之力 也会鼓舞自己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.29,0:16:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任务完成 回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:25.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 竟然有脸混进别人的社团挖墙角
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成了 双手刈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.90,0:16:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你练过柔道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坂东好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我阿晴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴一
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:16:59.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 这谁的名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他俩肯定会联系咱们的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪来的自信
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见他的毛巾了没
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们那样的人 就喜欢跟人扎堆一起做一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差一点...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不啊 很厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有天赋 阿远
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比不过你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你练得真努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里是一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说那俩人有消息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未必不行阿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.47,0:18:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我也努力了一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.52,0:18:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,画得好烂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没说这个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.69,0:18:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是想稍稍地宣传一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,召集部员
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...然后是高V来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 笑得开点 手抬高 看前面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的动作好僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要面带笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 正练着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:53.00,左上记,,0,0,0,,阿一：练习的视频已经发过去了，看看吧\N阿晴：喔，谢谢。过会儿会看的。\N阿一：那么明天大学见。宣传表演加油哦！！\N阿晴：...了解。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然 知道你只要决定了一件事就会拼了命去做
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.15,0:19:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还以为大清早没人经过呢 丟人...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要...要在这里演吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太显眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.09,0:19:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不显眼还有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:00.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位命志院大学的同学
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面是我们男子啦啦队的宣传表演
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边那位想做些新鲜事的男生！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边那位想做些好玩的事的男生！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要和我们一起竭尽全力为别人应援呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:40.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.35,0:20:42.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么 街头杂耍吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.94,0:20:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么社团
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:20:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:20:59.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.12,0:21:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那几个男生干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男生的啦啦队？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,WE ARE CHEER BOYS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦队 绝赞部员募集中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不出所料地入部了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.25,0:21:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本没料到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就想做些有新意又有意思的事 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.67,0:22:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我俩加入了 啦啦队可得更热闹
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下就有六个人了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.14,0:22:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 在学园祭就差一个了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差一个
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们几个刚才表演来着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表演什么 啦啦队是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他俩只是为了出风头勾搭妹子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:31.90,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(895.5,805.071)}{\c&HD59FE5&}最初的应援笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:31.90,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(917.785,787.929)}{\c&HE4DB75&}最初的应援笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:31.90,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(943.5,772.5)}最初的应援笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:33.29,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.62,0:22:34.96,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.38,0:22:36.59,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.67,0:22:39.30,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:45.01,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大声回应
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:48.60,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,崭新大门打开的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:51.64,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像紧紧握住的拳头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:55.02,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,决意坚定地响起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.31,0:22:58.44,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散发的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.57,0:23:01.82,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话感觉能改变些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:04.74,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是在寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:08.12,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.37,0:23:11.62,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,没有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.66,0:23:14.83,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自弃＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:16.71,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要输
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:18.34,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上应援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:22.92,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打气的动作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:26.30,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.43,0:23:29.93,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂头丧气抱怨「到极限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:33.27,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破极限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.56,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水SHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.65,0:23:39.73,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.07,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利的姿势＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:46.24,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,连同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.36,0:23:50.03,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着邂逅闪耀笑容的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.12,0:23:52.95,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.08,0:23:57.58,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:45.01,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:48.60,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:51.64,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:55.02,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.31,0:22:58.44,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.57,0:23:01.82,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:04.74,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:08.12,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.37,0:23:11.62,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.66,0:23:14.83,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:16.71,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:18.34,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:22.92,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:26.30,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.43,0:23:29.93,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:33.27,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.56,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.65,0:23:39.73,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.07,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:46.24,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.36,0:23:50.03,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.67,0:24:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松鼠次郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.88,0:24:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得是广告里的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.63,0:24:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还挺喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松鼠体态轻盈 要是我也能像松鼠那样该多好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想变成松鼠 我要成为松鼠之王
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下—集「第七人松鼠次郎」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.10,0:24:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
